operations.content:
{
  "$comment": [
    "Every entry carries a REASON, and a whole-file entry ('match': '*') also carries",
    "'max' -- the occurrence count when the decision was taken. The file may hold that",
    "many and no more: one new model name reds the gate even here. That is deliberate.",
    "An allowlist without a ratchet becomes a blanket, and a blanket exemption is",
    "indistinguishable from no gate at all.",
    "BY-DESIGN: permanent. PENDING-FIX(<plan-slug>): debt, owned by that plan, must",
    "shrink. Lower 'max' whenever a file improves -- the gate warns when you forget."
  ],
  "allow": [
    {
      "path": ".claude/agents/_shared/INVOCATION.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 5,
      "reason": "BY-DESIGN: records measured per-model cost evidence. The numbers mean nothing without the product names they were measured against, and evidence that cannot be re-checked is not evidence."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/skills/usage-monitoring/SKILL.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 5,
      "reason": "BY-DESIGN: a price table has to use the product names a user will see on their own bill. Tier language would make the table unreadable against the invoice it exists to explain."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/agents/coordinator.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 4,
      "reason": "BY-DESIGN: this prose explains the migration AWAY from model names and has to quote the names it is retiring. Removing them would delete the explanation."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/skills/eval-harness/SKILL.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 2,
      "reason": "BY-DESIGN: 'haiku' here is the poem form inside an eval example, not the model. The pattern cannot tell them apart; a human decided once and wrote it down."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/agents/QUICK_START.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 31,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): the largest concentration in the corpus; routing prose that should name capability tiers instead."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/commands/refine.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 10,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): names models for refinement passes; convert to most-capable / balanced / fast."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/commands/santa.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 8,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): the santa method is described in model names; the roles it assigns are capability roles."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/skills/santa-method/SKILL.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 6,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): same method, same conversion; fix with commands/santa.md so the two cannot disagree."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/commands/gan-build.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 3,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): generator/discriminator roles are named by model; they are capability roles."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/skills/gan-harness/SKILL.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 3,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): pairs with commands/gan-build.md; convert both together."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/skills/blueprint/SKILL.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 3,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): a three-model comparison line; decide in the fix pass whether it is evidence (keep) or routing (convert)."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/commands/code-review.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 2,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): names a model for the review pass instead of the accountability tier."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/commands/context-budget.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 2,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): context sizes quoted per model; state the budget, not the vendor name."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/commands/plan.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 2,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): planner routing prose; model-policy.json already owns this decision."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/skills/opensource-pipeline/SKILL.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 2,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): pipeline steps pinned to model names; convert to tiers."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/agents/code-reviewer.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 1,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): single occurrence, not yet triaged; convert or reclassify as BY-DESIGN in the fix pass."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/agents/docs.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 1,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): single occurrence, likely the poem form rather than the model; triage in the fix pass."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/commands/blueprint.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 1,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): single occurrence, not yet triaged; convert or reclassify as BY-DESIGN in the fix pass."
    },
    {
      "path": ".claude/commands/review.md",
      "match": "*",
      "max": 1,
      "reason": "PENDING-FIX(plan-prompt-model-name-fixpass): single occurrence, not yet triaged; convert or reclassify as BY-DESIGN in the fix pass."
    }
  ]
}
